Gym Vault bundles the "Anton" typeface (latin subset, woff2) by Vernon Adams,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).
It is embedded as a data URI in styles.css (source: src/font.css) so the
plugin renders identically on desktop and iOS with no network dependency.

Seed exercise demonstration images are linked from the free-exercise-db
project (https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db), released under the
Unlicense (public domain).

Some seed exercises additionally link demonstration photos and videos from
the wger project (https://wger.de), licensed CC-BY-SA 4.0 — videos by
Goulart, pull-up photo by Imobard. The media streams from wger.de and is
credited in the exercise notes that use it.
